OL,3,GNEWSACould a law change 'complete'
OL,4,ADaniel O'Connell's legacy?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's only taken 200 years but one of
OL,7,FIreland's most significant figures
OL,8,Fcould finally have his legacy
OL,9,F"completed".
OL,11,FDaniel O'Connell, a lawyer and
OL,12,Fpolitician, known as 'The Liberator',
OL,13,Fsuccessfully campaigned for Catholics
OL,14,Fto have more rights in Parliament in
OL,15,Fthe 1820s, but some restrictions on
OL,16,Ftheir roles still apply.
OL,18,FStreets in Dublin have been named after
OL,19,Fhim, but there is little recognition of
OL,20,Fhim in the halls of Westminster.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
